                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "VR Table Sports is a fun in between game! \nThe Foosball experience in VR is great, allowing you to feel like you're actually playing on a real table. \nThe precision and responsiveness of the controls make every movement feel natural and satisfying. \nMoving on to Ping pong, the realistic physics and fluid gameplay mechanics create an authentic tabletop tennis experience. \nFinally, air hockey in VR is nothing short of exhilarating, with fast-paced action and stunning visuals that make you feel like you're in an arcade. Overall, VR Table Sports offers endless fun and excitement for all virtual sports enthusiasts also via online multiplayer.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y98wSEtnvpk",
